<description>Author: &lt;a href="https://www.smspower.org:443/forums/profile.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=33851" target="_blank"&gt;Splats&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;

Posted: Sun Nov 01, 2026 2:15 pm (GMT 0)&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;  &lt;div class="attribution"&gt;Maxim wrote    &lt;script type="text/javascript" src="./templates/select_expand_bbcodes.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;    &lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;    
&lt;!--
        var id = 'SXBB' + (1000 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 5000));        SXBB[id] = new _SXBB(id);        SXBB[id].T['select'] = 'Select';        SXBB[id].T['expand'] = '[+]';        SXBB[id].T['contract'] = '[-]';        SXBB[id].writeCmd();    
//--&gt;
    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;div class="body"&gt;    &lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;      
&lt;!--
        SXBB[id].writeDiv();      
//--&gt;
    &lt;/script&gt;We tend to ignore Brazil and Korea in favour of Japan, USA and Europe for “where was it released”.    &lt;script type="text/javascript"&gt;      
&lt;!--
        document.write('&lt;/div&gt;');      
//--&gt;
    &lt;/script&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
Yeah, that makes sense. At the time, the latter three regions were the &amp;quot;main&amp;quot; gaming territories, while gamers elsewhere mostly had bootlegs and rebranded versions like the Samsung Gam*Boy.
&lt;br /&gt;

&lt;br /&gt;
And man, I didn't think this thread would get so in-depth, but it's for the best. Sometimes, mistakes can stick because nobody bothers to correct them, especially with ancient video games.&lt;br /&gt;

</description>
